    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multi scrolling mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seamlessly switching between side scroll, top-down, 3d shooter from behind and cut-scene. No camera cut during stage run. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Appearance</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No story narration. The story is abstract.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some parts of game are refered from other Touhou Project derivative works. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters are in alternate sexy costume<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480040/extras/1926031004e3d76c508b8ab71d366966.avif?t=1749715900\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Keyboard control (default)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrow keys : Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">z : Shoot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">x : Use bomb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">c : Use special skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Left shift : Slowdown movement and aim at enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Space bar : turn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">escape : pause game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can set key config as you want in the option menu.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Playable characters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hakurei Reimu<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480040/extras/2eac306784bb8f333205872b5c520f51.avif?t=1749715900\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kirisame Marisa<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480040/extras/f7910d3c9d1386e41680210d40d5fb67.avif?t=1749715900\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Izayoi Sakuya<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480040/extras/e17f5c7375dee1e2c2fd3d3ceb7243b6.avif?t=1749715900\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Miscellaneous game play features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 stages for main game + 1 extra stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 difficulties. Easy, Normal and Hard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Screen resolution setting. 3840x2160, 3200x1800, 2560x1440, 1920x1080, 1280x720, 640x360. Choose which ever suitable for your machine. The game has better performance with a lower resolution. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cel-shade and Hitbox style setting. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480040/extras/0608a93747d62df472723aac6fa605aa.avif?t=1749715900\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hp and Mp regenerate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlimited continue. When player dies, player can continue at any unlocked checkpoint. If player use continue, the remaining hp is set to small amount.  No bad ending even a player use continue. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill enemies in close range to get more bonus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill enemies consecutively to get more chain bonus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Partially Japanese and Chinese translation. (Tutorial and UI)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Save game location</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">C:UsersusernameAppDataLocalTHMSS2</p>",
